d=\"E1-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-43\" d=\"M56 342Q56 428 89 500T174 615T283 681T391 705Q394 705 400 705T408 704Q499 704 569 636L582 624L612 663Q639 700 643 704Q644 704 647 704T653 705H657Q660 705 666 699V419L660 413H626Q620 419 619 430Q610 512 571 572T476 651Q457 658 426 658Q322 658 252 588Q173 509 173 342Q173 221 211 151Q232 111 263 84T328 45T384 29T428 24Q517 24 571 93T626 244Q626 251 632 257H660L666 251V236Q661 133 590 56T403 -21Q262 -21 159 83T56 342Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-6F\" d=\"M28 214Q28 309 93 378T250 448Q340 448 405 380T471 215Q471 120 407 55T250 -10Q153 -10 91 57T28 214ZM250 30Q372 30 372 193V225V250Q372 272 371 288T364 326T348 362T317 390T268 410Q263 411 252 411Q222 411 195 399Q152 377 139 338T126 246V226Q126 130 145 91Q177 30 250 30Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-76\" d=\"M338 431Q344 429 422 429Q479 429 503 431H508V385H497Q439 381 423 345Q421 341 356 172T288 -2Q283 -11 263 -11Q244 -11 239 -2Q99 359 98 364Q93 378 82 381T43 385H19V431H25L33 430Q41 430 53 430T79 430T104 429T122 428Q217 428 232 431H240V385H226Q187 384 184 370Q184 366 235 234L286 102L377 341V349Q377 363 367 372T349 383T335 385H331V431H338Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-56\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-61\" x=\"750\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-72\" x=\"1251\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-5B\" x=\"1643\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-58\" x=\"1922\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"2996\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-59\" x=\"3997\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-5D\" x=\"4760\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"5317\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(6373,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-56\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-61\" x=\"750\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-72\" x=\"1251\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-5B\" x=\"8016\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-58\" x=\"8295\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-5D\" x=\"9148\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"9648\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(10649,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-56\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-61\" x=\"750\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-72\" x=\"1251\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-5B\" x=\"12292\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-59\" x=\"12571\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-5D\" x=\"13334\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"13835\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"14836\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(15336,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-43\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-6F\" x=\"722\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-76\" x=\"1223\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-5B\" x=\"17088\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-58\" x=\"17366\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"18219\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-59\" x=\"18664\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-5D\" x=\"19428\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Applying the definition of variance and using the linearity of expectation, we have</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"74.049ex\" height=\"16.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -7.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -3877 31882 7251.7\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"12\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 31.5em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c56\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c